# Generated inputs and run outputs — regenerate with gen_scenes.py / gen_geoms.py.
#
# Exception: the fine-text probe's assets are COMMITTED. They are nominally
# regenerable (`finetext_probe.py gen`), but generation needs a DejaVuSansMono
# binary at a hardcoded Linux path, and a different font *version* rasterises the
# 7-12px tiers differently — which silently makes fine-text scores non-comparable
# between hosts. Ship the bytes so every host scores the same input.
visimgs/*
!visimgs/scene_hd.png
!visimgs/document.png
!visimgs/chart.png
!visimgs/ground_truth.json
!visimgs/finetext.png
!visimgs/finetext_gt.json
testimgs/
extimgs/
resp_*.json
scores_*.json
ext_*.json
__pycache__/
ft_*.json
